{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15933","headline":"留别舍弟 · 王建","name":"留别舍弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤贱相长育，未曾爲远游。\n谁不重欢爱，晨昏阙珍羞。\n出门念衣车，草木当穷秋。\n非疾有忧叹，实爲人子尤。\n世情本难合，对面隔山丘。\n况复干戈地，儒夫何所投。\n与尔俱长成，尚爲沟壑忧。\n岂非轻岁月，少小不勤修。\n从今解思量，勉力谋善猷。\n但得成尔身，衣食宁我求。\n固合受此训，堕慢爲身羞。\n岁暮当归来，慎莫怀远游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15933.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15933","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}